1
00:05:43,333 --> 00:05:49,333
Bitter Harvest is a war, drama, history film directed by George Mendeluk.

2
00:11:26,666 --> 00:11:32,666
Set between the two World Wars and based on true historical events, Bitter Harvest conveys the untold
story of the Holodomor, the genocidal famine engineered by the tyrant Joseph Stalin.

3
00:17:10,000 --> 00:17:16,000
The film displays a powerful tale of love, honour, rebellion and survival at a time when Ukraine was
forced to adjust to the horrifying territorial ambitions of the burgeoning Soviet Union.

4
00:22:53,333 --> 00:22:59,333
Yuri, played by Max Irons.

5
00:28:36,666 --> 00:28:42,666
Natalka, played by Samantha Barks.

6
00:34:20,000 --> 00:34:26,000
Ivan, played by Terence Stamp.

7
00:40:03,333 --> 00:40:09,333
Yaroslav, played by Barry Pepper.

8
00:45:46,666 --> 00:45:52,666
Sergei, played by Tamer Hassan.

9
00:51:30,000 --> 00:51:36,000
