10
00:57:13,333 --> 00:57:19,333
Bitter Harvest is a 2017 period romantic-drama film set
in Soviet Ukraine in the early 1930s.

11
01:02:56,666 --> 01:03:02,666
The film is the first English language feature film
depicting Ukraine's famine, the 1932–33 Holodomor.

12
01:08:40,000 --> 01:08:46,000
The film stars Max Irons, Samantha Barks, Barry Pepper,
Tamer Hassan, Lucy Brown and Terence Stamp.

13
01:14:23,333 --> 01:14:29,333
The film was directed by George Mendeluk.

14
01:20:06,666 --> 01:20:12,666
The story and screenplay were written by Canadian
screenwriter-actor Richard Bachynsky Hoover.

15
01:25:50,000 --> 01:25:56,000
Filming took place in and around Kyiv, Ukraine.

16
01:31:33,333 --> 01:31:39,333
The film explores themes of famine, genocide,
ukrainian village, 1930s, holodomor.

17
01:37:16,666 --> 01:37:22,666
The tone is emotional.
